flowchart TD
    A([Reseller returns selected original packs with photos]) --> B[Default same products and quantities at original paid prices]
    B --> C{Supervisor or Owner review}
    C -->|Return not approved| X([Decline with public explanation])
    C -->|Originals can be supplied| F[Record approval and current offer]
    C -->|Originals unavailable| D[Offer alternative with explanation]
    D -->|No acceptable alternative| RA[Approve returned-goods eligibility]
    RA --> R[Authorized refund conversion]
    D --> E{Value versus approved return credit}
    E -->|Lower| D
    E -->|Equal or higher| F
    F --> H[Inventory verifies complete returned-goods receipt into non-sellable custody]
    F --> G[Keep default acceptance or obtain reseller acceptance of changed offer]
    H --> RG{Complete receipt and current offer accepted?}
    G --> RG
    RG -->|No| W[Wait for remaining receipt or acceptance]
    W --> RG
    RG -->|Yes| I{Extra payment due?}
    I -->|Yes| J[Reseller submits exact difference; processor verifies received funds]
    I -->|No| K[Inventory reserves shared FEFO stock and marks ready]
    J --> K
    K --> L{Eligible stock available?}
    L -->|No| M[Wait for valid restock; keep accepted offer and verified payment]
    M --> K
    L -->|Yes| N[Inventory revalidates and releases; deduct physical stock once]
    N --> O[Supervisor or Owner confirms delivery]
    O --> P([Complete replacement])
    F -. No acceptable supply before release .-> R[Authorized refund conversion]
    M -. No acceptable supply before release .-> R
    R --> S[Follow refund-conversion diagram]
